# Custom direct rules (Mihomo classical / text; omit target policy)
# Keep at least one active entry to avoid empty-ruleset errors.
#
# Examples:
#   DOMAIN,exact.example.com
#   DOMAIN-SUFFIX,example.com
#   DOMAIN-KEYWORD,internal
#   IP-CIDR,192.168.10.0/24,no-resolve
#   IP-CIDR6,fd00::/8,no-resolve
#   PROCESS-NAME,app.exe
#   DST-PORT,8080

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,local
IP-CIDR,172.32.0.0/12,no-resolve
